{
  "Scenes.Alraune.Charge.Blocked": "By unfathomable fortune, you react swiftly enough to raise your [shield] in time."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Charge.ClawSlamHit": "She slams into you, sinking her claws as deeply as she can manage before you fight her off."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Charge.Miss": "By unfathomable fortune, you react swiftly enough to evade her dangerous swipe."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Charge.RootsFlexCharge": "The sound of her dense roots flexing is the only brief warning before the alraune suddenly sprints toward you, claws at the ready! "
  "Scenes.Alraune.Description": "The alluring plant-girl before you stands at what would be nearly a typical female height if she were human, though the many black vines snaking out and around her body assure you that she is as monstrous as anything else. The deep and dark purples and indigos of her lips, eyes, and hair are in stark contrast with her pale and almost lifeless-looking skin. {0} Her hands seem gentle and soft, but coiled around and extending beyond them are thorn-covered vines she can use as whips."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Description.Rooted": "The base of her body, below the waist, is a giant flower of black, violet, and red, and the many smaller flowers sprouting from her vines and hair share those colors."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Description.Uprooted": "Below her thighs are thick, charcoal-black roots bent sharply in the form of digitigrade legs, ending in long claws."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Entangle.SlimeSlipsFree": "careening into your slimy mass, but failing to maintain a hold as you slip out."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Entangle.TightlyBound": "twirling around you until they have you tightly bound in place."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Entangle.VinesMissLeap": "missing widely as you leap away."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Entangle.VinesSling": "Stealthy dark vines sling themselves at your [legs], "
  "Scenes.Alraune.HandleAwardItemText.CoalEyeshadow": "\nSearching what remains of her after the ordeal, you find a few small lumps of coal! Eyeshadow, perhaps? "
  "Scenes.Alraune.HandleAwardItemText.EarthyGown": "\nRummaging through her things, you find some old earthy gown of grass and twigs. It's rather cheap-looking, clearly not well-designed at all. Recognizing garbage for what it is, you toss it. "
  "Scenes.Alraune.HandleAwardItemText.PumpkinSeedFound": "\nYou discover a huge pumpkin seed amongst the petals of her flower. At least, you think it's a pumpkin seed. It's unlikely the land around your camp could support growing an alraune anyway. "
  "Scenes.Alraune.HandleAwardItemText.WhiskeyBottle": "\nWith a degree of shock, you notice a bottle of whiskey inside the gaping hole in her back. "
  "Scenes.Alraune.Lash.Blocked": "You block the strike with your [shield]."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Lash.Miss": "You steer clear, if only just."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Lash.Parried": "You barely manage to knock her claw away from you with your [weapon]."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Lash.VineClawBites": "The sudden increase in range, however slight, is hard to account for, and her claws bite into you."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Lash.VineClawSwipe": "The mobile alraune, cackling menacingly, swipes with her vine-claw, swinging it out a short distance ahead of her. "
  "Scenes.Alraune.Name": "black velvet alraune"
  "Scenes.Alraune.Root.RetreatsToNest": "Exhausted from the high-speed brawl, the alraune retreats to her floral nest."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Tease.BaresBreasts": "Stretching, the alraune bares her soft and modestly-sized breasts, capped with pink nipples."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Tease.FlowersKiss": "[say: Aren't you curious how it'll feel for our flowers to kiss?] she says with a wink."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Tease.NaturesNectar": "[say: Come taste nature's nectar,] she says, lowering the petals around her groin nearly enough to expose her pussy."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Tease.PistilStamen": "[say: Wouldn't you like your pistil to meet my stamen?] she says with a wink."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Tease.PollinateMe": "[say: Come here and pollinate me,] she says with a wink."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Tease.ShakesHips": "The alraune shakes her hips, bringing several of her rose-sprouting vines near her to frame her feminine form."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Tease.SowSeeds": "Curling her finger in an inviting fashion, the alraune says, [say: Please, sow your seeds in this fertile ground.]"
  "Scenes.Alraune.Uproot.UprootsFromNest": "As the alraune has become fed up with stationary combat, a squelching and cracking sound signals her uprooting. Her somewhat moist lower-body appears to be coiled roots, bent sharply into the shape of legs. The vines of her arms pull closer to her hands, forming large, thorny claws."
  "Scenes.Alraune.VineTrip.HiddenVinesTrip": "[pg]Vines hidden in the grass and muck spring to action as you attempt to quickly move, {0}"
  "Scenes.Alraune.VineTrip.NearlySnaring": "nearly snaring your [legs]! The alraune seems very unamused."
  "Scenes.Alraune.VineTrip.SnaringFall": "snaring your [legs]! With the momentum you had, you immediately fall heavily into the ground as the alraune laughs at you."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Whip.Miss": "nearly smacking you."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Whip.Parried": "but you manage to keep them away with your [weapon]."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Whip.VineWhipHit": "careening directly into your body."
  "Scenes.Alraune.Whip.VineWhipLead": "The black vines near you swipe at your position, "
}
